WEBVTT

00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:15,740
I have been doing high dose IV vitamin C treatments, but feel I need to take a break as my veins

00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:18,180
are getting harder to access.

00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:26,100
I read this supplement, Valastin Extensicin, can be an equivalent to the IVs.

00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,580
I think we answered this question last week.

00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:35,380
Are you familiar with this and how helpful do you think IV vitamin C is for battling cancer?

00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:38,860
Well, I think IV vitamin C can be great for battling cancer.

00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,660
But I don't think there's anything wrong with taking a break.

00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:51,380
I think, like I said, last week, I think giving yourself a break on a therapy for a period

00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:54,260
of time can be beneficial.

00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:59,460
And I said last week also that this last, I think I have another patient that's taking this

00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:07,100
high dose, extensive, and the topical form, and he said he's having benefit.

00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,500
And I haven't spoke to him for a couple of weeks now.

